{"id":"lento","lemma":"lento","pos":"adj","rank":1791,"glosses":["slow"],"ipa":"/ˈlento/","forms":{"feminine":"lenta","masculinePlural":"lentos","femininePlural":"lentas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-lento.wav","examples":[{"text":"El autobús es lento.","en":"The bus is slow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442079","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"bus, coach"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Los negocios son lentos.","en":"Business is slow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442997","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"business, enterprise","l":"negocio"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"\"Rápido\" es el contrario de \"lento\".","en":"\"Fast\" is the opposite of \"slow.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37560","words":[{"g":"rapid"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"contrary, opposite"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ella es una corredora lenta.","en":"She is a slow runner.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453439","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"running","l":"corredor"},null]},{"text":"¿Podrías hablar más lento, por favor?","en":"Would you speak more slowly, please?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594183","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"more"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"please"]]}]}